  "releaseNotes": "2.3.0 — Single-File & Stream Ingestion + CLI Secret/PII Gate. Added FolderScrubber.ReadFileAsync(string) and ReadFileAsync(Stream, string) for direct in-memory and single-file extraction/redaction; added --fail-on-redaction to Scrubkit.Tool CLI for CI/CD gating. Full changelog: https://github.com/jjopensoftworks-blip/Scrubkit/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
